  description="Terms for using the Zo Media Productions website, including content, donations, and third-party links."
  updated="October 6, 2026"
>
  <p>
    By using zomediaproductions.com (the "Site") you agree to these terms. The Site is operated by {SITE.legalName}, a
    subsidiary of the {SITE.parent.name}.
  </p>

  <h2>Our content</h2>
  <p>
    The books, films, articles, images, and other works on this Site belong to Zo Media Productions or to the incarcerated
    creators who made them, and are protected by copyright. You may read, share links to, and quote short excerpts with
    credit. Please ask us before reproducing or republishing a work, or using it commercially.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>
    Please do not misuse the Site: no attempts to disrupt it, gain unauthorized access, send spam through our forms, or
    use our content to harass or defame anyone.
  </p>

  <h2>Donations and purchases</h2>
  <p>
    Donations are processed by our donation platform on behalf of the {SITE.parent.shortName}, {SITE.parent.note}.
    Whether a gift is tax-deductible depends on your circumstances; please consult a tax advisor. Book availability, pricing,
    and purchase options are subject to change.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party links</h2>
