    extent allowed by law we are not liable for damages arising from your use of the Site.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. Continued use of the Site after a change means you accept the updated terms.</p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Oklahoma, without regard to conflict-of-law rules.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions? Write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
